  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The terrace and boundary treatment, by reason of its location, scale, material and proximity to neighbouring habitable room windows on 142 Stephendale Road, would introduce an unneighbourly form of development which results in a loss of light and outlook for this neighbour. Thus, the proposal would be detrimental to the residential amenity of these neighbours. The proposal is contrary to Policies HO11 and CC12 of the Local Plan 2018 and Key Principle HS7 (i) Planning Guidance SPD 2018. \r\n",
    "Reason : 2 - The terrace, by reason of its location, scale and proximity to neighbouring properties, particularly 142 Stephendale Road and 2 Glenrosa Steet, would introduce an unneighbourly form of development which results in a increased noise nuisance for neighbours. Thus, the proposal would be detrimental to the residential amenity of these neighbours. The proposal is contrary to Policies HO11, CC11 and CC13 of the Local Plan 2018 and Key Principle HS8 Planning Guidance SPD 2018. ",
    "Reason : 3 - The terrace and boundary treatment, by reason of its scale, form, design and materials of the would result in an over dominant and incongruous addition to the host property which is out of keeping with the character and appearance of the existing appearance of character of the host property and surroundings. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies DC1 and DC4 and of the Local Plan 2018.\r\n"
  ],
